<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(4) Non-U.S. Person Certification.
The undersigned certifies that (i) it is not a &ldquo;U.S. person&rdquo; as defined in Regulation S under the Securities Act of 1933,
as amended, and is not exercising this Warrant for the account or benefit of any U.S. person, (ii) this Warrant is not being exercised
within the United States, and (iii) it has not engaged and will not engage in hedging transactions involving the Warrant Shares except
in compliance with the Securities Act; or, if the undersigned cannot make the foregoing certifications, the undersigned has delivered
to the Company a written opinion of counsel reasonably satisfactory to the Company to the effect that the exercise of this Warrant and
the issuance of the Warrant Shares are exempt from the registration requirements of the Securities Act.</P>

